  - m_Id: 4193247232
    m_Localized: Fight Scene
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6047129600
    m_Localized: "The fight took place close to the door on the kitchen side of the
      interior wall. Apart from a few broken ceramics and knocked-over chairs, there
      was little damage at the scene of the fight. \nIt seems most of the struggle
      took place in one spot while lying down. Both participants sustained limited
      injuries.\nKaras has cuts from broken ceramics on his left arm. Mary suffered
      more severe head bumps, although there was no concussion."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
